hat you want the empire to mean.',detail:'The warehouse hums with activity. June, Pip, and Sol wait for your answer. The Lark Street Collective has gone quiet. The city still watches. This is the part nobody can decide for you.',choices:[['Build something that lasts','Your crew is proud. +50 reputation, attention falls.',()=>{state.rep+=50;state.heat=Math.max(0,state.heat-20)}],['Take the city’s biggest deal','A final risky payday. +$600, +25 attention.',()=>{state.cash+=600;state.heat+=25}]]}];
